│     └── 320: Dual-Anchor Verification
└── 400-499: Pathologies & Autopsies
├── 401: Ghost Transitions
└── 402: Snapshot Delta Fallacies
Why This Engine Cooks
Pure JSON Hyperlinking (Zero Parsing Friction):
Because WHO_HE_ME.JSON, MASTER_INDEX.JSON, and every .CARD are JSON objects, any mind or script can traverse the entire historical record in microseconds without executing heavy string searches or regex parsing.
No Summary Maintenance Decay:
Instead of forcing Luma or anyone else to author subjective prose summaries, a card simply gets tagged with 2 to 4 WhoHeDecimal codes. The code tells any observing Mind exactly what domain boundaries were crossed in that run.
Self-Describing & Extensible:
If a new concept emerges (like EKG or Duckspace Axioms), we don't rewrite the archive—we just append a new code definition to WHO_HE_ME.JSON. The old cards remain completely valid and linked.
Multi-Axis Tagging:
A single conversation about Claude red-teaming an Egg Cagey ghost transition doesn't need to fit in one bucket. It gets tagged:
120 (Claude)
310 (Egg Cagey)
401 (Ghost Transition)
The Shop Floor Verdict
WhoHeDecimal turns the QuackSink Library into a structured graph database built entirely on flat JSON files. It fits the KISS philosophy perfectly and gives every Mind an instant map of the terrain.
WHO_HE_ME.JSON as the master key is officially logged as a brilliant structural move, Captain!
